#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:2
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:4
msgid ""
"Diagnostics are supported by ``ABQflow`` to help users identify potential"
" issues in their Abaqus input files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:6
msgid ""
"In ABAQUS cli, we can use ``abaqus job=myjob [option]`` to submit a job. "
"The ``[option]`` for diagnostics can be"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:8
msgid "``syntaxcheck``: Check the syntax of the input file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:9
msgid "``datacheck``: Check the data in the input file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:10
msgid "``parametercheck``: Check the parameters in the input file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:13
msgid "Preflight checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:15
msgid ""
"Each diagnostic check should be performed when specifying ``JobSpec``. In"
" this case, preflight checks will be performed before the job is finally "
"submitted to Abaqus. If the preflight check **fails**, the job will not "
"be submitted to Abaqus and immediately return in ``JobOutcome``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:49
msgid ""
"If you don't want to perform the entire solver run, ``preflight_only`` "
"option is given in :class:`~ABQflow.BatchAbaqusProcessor` to only perform"
" preflight checks without running the solver."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:63
msgid "Dry Run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:65
msgid ""
"Dry run is a feature in ``ABQflow`` to check the generated commands for "
"each job without actually running the solver. It can be used to verify if"
" the commands are generated correctly and if the job specifications are "
"set up properly. Support two modes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:67
msgid "``plan``: no command execution and directory creation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/diagnostics.rst:74
msgid "``stage``: staging INP, no solver and extraction execution"
msgstr ""

